sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sub as moq-sub (eu-central)
    participant Edge as relay eu-central
    participant Origin as relay us-west (origin)
    participant Pub as moq-pub

    Pub->>Origin: SETUP(publisher) + ANNOUNCE cam0
    Origin-->>Pub: ANNOUNCE_OK
    Note over Pub,Origin: each group (1s GOP) rides its own QUIC uni stream

    Sub->>Edge: SETUP(subscriber) + SUBSCRIBE cam0
    Note over Edge: track unknown locally
    Edge->>Origin: SETUP(relay) + SUBSCRIBE cam0
    Origin-->>Edge: SUBSCRIBE_OK + cached group from its keyframe
    Edge-->>Sub: SUBSCRIBE_OK + cached group from its keyframe
    Note over Sub: playback starts without waiting<br/>for the next keyframe

    loop live fanout
        Pub->>Origin: group g objects
        Origin-->>Edge: forwarded as they arrive
        Edge-->>Sub: forwarded as they arrive
    end

    Note over Edge: slow subscriber?<br/>drop OLDEST WHOLE GROUP,<br/>never partial groups
